		{
			title: "Teleporter Here"
			x: 0.5d
			y: -5.75d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7The Transportalizer is a machine that can transport you to another Transportalizer."
				""
				"&7When you place one down, it generates a random 4 character code. When you Right Click the Transportalizer, you can see that one's code, as well as a space to put in another Transportalizer's code."
				""
				"&7When you put in another Transportalizer code, you can use the machine to teleport to it. "
				""
				"&7Note that this is one way! To get back to the first Transportalizer, you'll need to input it's code into another Transportalizer."
				""
				"&7Also, if you combine a Transportalizer with a Pink and Light Blue dye, you get a special decorated one. Neat!"
			]
			dependencies: ["6F2679D258D56AD2"]
			id: "68EAD04BCEEAB3CA"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1B4E6D1295BA3865"
