		{
			title: "Special Explosives"
			x: -3.25d
			y: -4.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7With Alchemy you can make some specialized versions of TNT."
				""
				"&7Primed TNT is TNT frozen right as it's activated. A simple little 'punch' will resume its countdown. No need to mess with Redstone!"
				""
				"&7Unstable TNT is... I'm not sure, but I think its a bit more explosive? I'd just be careful around it is all."
				""
				"&7Instant TNT is what it says on the tin. When its activated, it immediately explodes. This is where you REALLY want to use Redstone circuits... or maybe just a pressure plate in the right spot for someone else."
				""
				"&7Last are some TNT Buttons. When activated, they explode after a few seconds. Which... I don't know why you want that, other than to prank other assistants?"
			]
