		{
			title: "A More Modern Jukebox"
			x: -14.5d
			y: 4.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7The TFB Shop Tablet has a bunch of stuff that's useful, but also a few things that are just...fun to have."
				""
				"&7One of them is the Cassette Player. This plays Casette Tapes, which you can make using Alchemy, combining a (Punched) Casette Player card with various Music Discs."
				""
				"&7You can set out the Casette Player like a Jukebox, then Right Click a Cassette onto it to insert it. Then Sneak + Right Click the Cassette Player to start the tape up! (Make sure your off hand is free though)"
