		{
			title: "Strange Snacks"
			x: -4.5d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "What a Pair of Names..."
			description: [
				"&7The lands of the Medium had a lot of dungeons and places to explore. You could find a wide variety of treasures and toys and food."
				""
				"&7Most of these were useful as themselves and didn't really do much else. But a few of them were needed to Alchemize new items and weapons."
				""
				"&7Take these two items. Deep breath and... \"Hellacious Blue Phlegm Aneurysm Gushers\" and the \"Bodacious Black Liquid Sorrow Gushers\" need other items from the Medium to craft."
				""
				"&7Since the Medium is no longer available, you can find most of the key items in the [TFB] Shop Tablet. Well, at least ones you can't make by Alchemy combining things you already can get from the Oveworld or the Vaults."
			]
			dependencies: ["4EAEC7D5C5DD1893"]
			id: "5D1BFAD59386BF52"
