		{
			title: "Basic Sylladex Modus"
			x: -3.25d
			y: -5.75d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7Like I mentioned, your Sylladex starts off in Queue mode. Things get added to the left side, and can only be taken out of the right side."
				""
				"&7But you can change the mode of how items are stored and retrieved from your Sylladex by changing its Modus. The other simple Modus you can swap to is Stack."
				""
				"&7With Stack Modus, its like a stack of books. You add an item to the left, and can only take the left most item."
				""
				"&7To change the Modus of your Sylladex, take the Modus card, and hit G to open your Minestuck menu. Place the new Modus card into the Sylladex spot you usually add new Captchalogue cards to, and hit Use Item. It'll swap the new Modus in and your old Modus out."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["6A21DB08C3F1E5A7"]
