		}
		{
			title: "Alternate Modus"
			x: -2.0d
			y: -5.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7With Alchemy, you can create a few different Modus for your Sylladex."
				""
				"&7The Queue-Stack Modus combines the two. Items are added to the left side, and the Left most AND the Right most items can be removed."
				""
				"&7The Tree Modus is.... very different. The first item added is the Root. When another item is added, it gets sorted alphabetically, to one of two branches (if it comes before or after the Root alphabetically)"
				""
				"&7When the Root has two 'branches', the next item added goes to the left most 'branch' available, becoming either the left or right branch alphabetically."
				""
				"&7Each 'branch' can branch out to two cards. Those cards can branch out again. And again. The last card of every branch is called a Leaf."
				""
				"&7Leaf cards can be pulled out freely. But removing a Branch or Root will cause all cards under it to drop."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"3357D6C93A0DEB53"
				"4EAEC7D5C5DD1893"
			]
			id: "450FD08EFACAD8BC"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "44870CF436A379B2"
					type: "item"
					item: "minestuck:queuestack_modus_card"
				}
				{
