					type: "item"
					item: "minestuck:tree_modus_card"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "6C3A1553D5E7F885"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Interesting Modus"
			x: -0.75d
			y: -5.75d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7Set Modus has the benefit of letting you pull any item in it when you want, no messing with Stacks or Queues."
				""
				"&7The downside? You can only have one of a specific item at a time. "
				""
				"&7Alternatively, you can use the Hashmap Modus. Every item's name can be converted into a Hash, a sort of math formula derived thing."
				""
				"&7While this one lets you keep up to a stack of an item, you cannot keep more as multiple Captchalogue cards cannot have the same Hash. This also means different items with the same name, or even rarely some items with different names, may have the same Hash."
			]
			dependencies: ["450FD08EFACAD8BC"]
			id: "2D44BE5D2DDBF4E9"
			tasks: [
