		{
			x: -10.142857142857132d
			y: -4.982142857142847d
			shape: "gear"
			description: [
				"&7If it hasn't become clear yet, the SBurb Alchemy System opens up a special door for you. A backdoor to getting items, outside of the DLC system."
				""
				"&7With it, you can Alchemize many of the items you find and collect in various Vaults, as well as many of the items that you can get with our TFB Blind Boxes!"
				""
				"&7This is why I mentioned this would be a boon to both of us. The Alchemy system pulls from the lost parts of the FOP's system much like our Blind Boxes do. So Alchemizing new items, and selling them, using them, will continue to spread the Aubudon Worm in new, different ways."
			]
			dependencies: ["10E2B9F70E803BDB"]
			size: 0.75d
			id: "1A63950EB5B750C9"
			tasks: [{
				id: "78415BE1EDF9A7C0"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "SUBverting in the SBURB"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Glitchless?"
			x: -5.0625d
			y: -5.0625d
			shape: "gear"
			description: [
				"&7Not gotten to that part of the bosses'  guidance? Or did you accidentally use all your Unobtanium?"
				""
				"&7That's okay! You can always replicate the original glitch yourself! How?"
				""
				"&7Well, first you need FOUR Netherite Ingots. And a Nether Portal. Make sure that the Nether side of the portal is clear of lava and fires and stuff..."
				""
				"&7On the Overworld side of the portal, throw each ingot into the Nether Portal one at a time. Then just...go into the Nether and pick up your Unobtanium!"
				""
				"&7How? Well, if you remember Botania and the Alfheim portal, the FOP needed to replicate its function within the FOPGame Server. So they copied and modified the Nether Portal code."
				""
				"&7But someone messed up and ALSO changed a bit of the Nether Portal code and, well.... Anyways, here's some extra too!"
			]
			dependencies: ["52754C14A4625112"]
			size: 0.75d
			id: "07C789B6CD2AA8C6"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1AFECA5C0154B012"
