		{
			title: "SBurban Machines 1"
			x: 1.75d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7It looks like before the FOPGame Server shut down and swapped to Vault Hunters, there were some machines in the works."
				""
				"&7The Trajectory Block will launch a creature in the direction of the fan, with the strength of a Redstone Signal applied."
				""
				"&7The Stat Storer will fire off a Redstone Signal if the setting in the block's interace activates. It'll fire off the Redstone Strength listed in the interface."
				""
				"&7The Remote Observer can be set to watch for a condition, and fire off a full Redstone Signal when its met."
				""
				"&7The Platform Generator will extend a temporary line of blocks when a Redstone Signal is applied to it. If it passes through a Platform Receptical block, that block will emit a Redstone Signal. This is a good way to chain Platform Generators to make a wide one."
			]
			dependencies: ["4EAEC7D5C5DD1893"]
