		{
			title: "SBurban Machines 2"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7The Item Magnet will pull items in front of the magnet from a distance. Right Click the Item Magnet to reverse direction and PUSH items instead."
				""
				"&7The Remote Comparator...I'm not quite sure how this works, Bandit. There isn't really any documentation on these in the code."
				""
				"&7The Wireless Redstone Transmitter and Receiver work together. The Transmitter will trasmit Redstone Signals across to a Receiver, if the Receiver's Coordinates are correctly set in the Transmitter."
				""
				"&7You can Right Click the Receiver to tell it to 'store' the Redstone Signal and keep emitting it, even when the Transmitter has stopped sending. Otherwise it will stop emitting Redstone when the Transmitter stops sending it."
			]
			dependencies: ["4EAEC7D5C5DD1893"]
