		{
			title: "SBurban Machines 3"
			x: 4.25d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7The Redstone Clock will send out a Redstone Pulse like clockwork. You can change the time between pulses by Right Clicking it."
				""
				"&7The Rotator will rotate Minestuck/SBurb machines placed atop it when supplied with a Redstone Pulse. Not all machines can be rotated, but ones like the Item Magnet can."
				""
				"&7The Toggler is...well, supposed to 'toggle' SBurb/Minestuck machines that change state when you Right Click them when hit with a Redstone Pulse. But uh...not sure if it works? Maybe you can get it working, Bandit."
				""
				"&7The Fall Pad isn't quite a machine, but it WILL prevent fall damage (as long as you land on it properly!)"
