		{
			title: "SBurban Redstone 1"
			x: 1.75d
			y: 4.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7There is a series of Switches you can make to help with your Redstone designs."
				""
				"&7The Solid Switch is basically a full block form of a Lever. Toggle on and off by Right Clicking."
				""
				"&7The Variable Switch will tick up one Redstone Power every time you Right Click, and down 1 power when you Sneak + Right Click it with an open hand."
				""
				"&7There are two Timed Solid Switches that will start at 15 power (max) when Right Clicked, then lose 1 power every 1 or 2 seconds."
